ARCHITECTURE DIRECTORY (tam-mail)

This folder is for architecture notes. It documents the architectural
patterns, data structures, and algorithms of the reference implementations
tracked in ideas/, as well as how tam-mail plans to implement or adapt
them under the Tamlinux philosophy (pure C11, minimal dependencies,
libtam-only linkage, and first-class Linux virtual console support).

Contents:

- aerc.md : Architectural mechanisms documented for aerc (ideas/aerc.md)
            and tam-mail's planned C11/libtam data structures & algorithms.
